he entire white mesh body, scattered evenly with the cloud pointing down.\n  Each rose-cluster is rendered in canonical full color (saturated red roses,\n  kelly-green stems, white-and-blue cloud) on the white ground. **Technique:**\n  sublimated. **Color:** canonical multi-color red green white blue on white\n  mesh.\n- **wearer-left front/side body** (large, diagonal): The \"Love Hurts\" wordmark\n  in red cursive script spans the white mesh toward the left side seam. The\n  adjacent black mesh inset carries a smaller red Love Hurts emblem with\n  rose/heart artwork. **Technique:** large treatment sublimated; small inset\n  mark embroidered. **Color:** canonical Love Hurts red with black artwork and\n  green/red rose detail.\n- **wearer-right side inset** (black mesh panel): A red rose bouquet with green\n  stems above a white-and-blue cloud is embroidered on the black mesh inset.\n  **Technique:** embroidered. **Color:** red, green, white, and blue on black\n  mesh.\n\n### Back\n\n- **back-body** (white mesh field, continues from front): Same all-over Red\n  Roses Cloud Cluster pattern as the front, continuing across the rear.\n  **Technique:** sublimated. **Color:** canonical multi-color on white mesh.\n- **back-wearer-left** (large upper-side treatment): A large red-and-black\n  broken-heart/paint treatment with descending red Love Hurts script crosses the\n  upper wearer-left rear and continues toward the left side seam. Preserve its\n  scale, direction, and relationship to the repeating rose field. **Technique:**\n  sublimated. **Color:** canonical red and black.\n- **rear pockets** (exactly two, below waistband): Two\n  horizontal-to-slightly-angled zippered rear pockets finished with black\n  perforated trim and black zipper closures. Both rear pockets contain zippers.\n  **Technique:** stitched zipper pocket. **Color:** black.\n\n### Sleeves / Collar / Hem / Other\n\n- **waistband** (~1.5in tall, top of shorts): Black ribbed-knit elasticated\n  waistband. **Technique:** stitched. **Color:** black.\n- **drawstring** (waistband-thread, ~24in long): White flat drawstring threaded\n  through the waistband. **Technique:** stitched. **Color:** white.\n- **left-pocket** (upper wearer-left side): Angled zippered hand pocket\n  immediately below the waistband, finished with black perforated trim and a\n  black zipper closure. **Technique:** stitched zipper pocket. **Color:** black.\n- **right-pocket** (upper wearer-right side): Angled zippered hand pocket\n  immediately below the waistband, finished with black perforated trim and a\n  black zipper closure. **Technique:** stitched zipper pocket. **Color:** black.\n- **leg-binding** (each leg opening, ~1in wide): Black perforated binding with\n  parallel red and white contrast stripes tracing the angular basketball-short\n  hem. **Technique:** stitched. **Color:** black, red, and white.\n- **inside-waistband** (~1.5in × 0.5in, interior tag): Branded woven size tag.\n  **Technique:** woven-label. **Color:** brand-label palette.\n\n## Negative — what is NOT on this product (DO NOT render)\n\n- NO solid-color body — the entire body has the sublimated all-over rose-cluster\n  pattern, NOT a plain white mesh field.\n- NO greyscale rendering of the rose-cluster — this is the LOVE HURTS variant in\n  **canonical full color** (red roses + green stems + white-and-blue cloud), NOT\n  the Black Rose greyscale variant.\n- NO Black Rose three-rose-cluster on this product — this is a Love Hurts\n  product, the cluster is the **red-roses** variant only.\n- NO black mesh body — body is WHITE mesh (distinct from br-007 BR×LH shorts\n  which has black mesh).\n- NO contrast color side-panels — body is uniform white mesh with the sublimated\n  pattern; no white-mesh-vs-black-mesh side panel distinction (that's br-007).\n- NO OAKLAND tackle-twill wordmark — that's br-007. This product has only the\n  Love Hurts cursive wordmark.\n- NO COLORWAY OVERRIDE — colors render in canonical Love Hurts palette, NOT\n  remapped to greyscale or tonal.\n- NO black drawstring — drawstring is WHITE.\n- NO white waistband — waistband is BLACK ribbed.\n- NO open, zipperless, patch, or cargo pockets — the product has exactly four\n  pockets, and all four have zipper closures: two side pockets and two rear\n  pockets.\n- NO plain back — the physical back includes two black zippered rear pockets and\n  the large red-and-black wearer-left Love Hurts treatment.\n- NO sublimated pattern in greyscale — the all-over rose pattern is canonical\n  multi-color.\n- NO mirrored side branding — the large red Love Hurts treatment belongs on\n  wearer-left; the rose-bouquet/cloud inset belongs on wearer-right.\n- NO embossed/debossed decoration anywhere.\n- NO sleeve elements (this is a shorts garment, lower-body only).\n- NO numbers anywhere — no jersey numerals.\n- NO Authentic Collection patch — that patch is reserved for the Black Rose\n  jersey series.\n\n## Scene direction\n\n- **Pose:** Front view straight-on (laid flat or on an approved model) showing\n  the all-over rose pattern, wearer-left red Love Hurts treatment, wearer-right\n  rose-bouquet/cloud inset, black waistband, both zippered side pockets when the\n  angle exposes them, and black/red/white angular leg binding. For the back:\n  show the continuous rose pattern, both black zippered rear pockets, and the\n  large wearer-left red-and-black rear treatment. Across all views, preserve\n  exactly two side pockets and two rear pockets, with a zipper closure on every\n  pocket. Use the matching directional side source whenever a side panel is\n  visible; never mirror it.\n- **Setting:** Pure white studio backdrop, soft directional studio lighting from\n  front-left, subtle natural drop shadow on the floor.\n"
